      "title": "Synthid-Bypass Video v2.0 - Install Map",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Synthid-Bypass Video v2.0 - Model & Custom Nodes Map\n\nInstalacao rapida em servidor remoto (auto-detecta GPU):\n  bash setup_remote.sh            (auto-detect via nvidia-smi)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 4000pro    (RTX 4000 Pro 20GB)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 4500pro    (RTX 4500 Pro 24GB)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 6000pro    (RTX 6000 Pro 96GB + bf16)\n\nCustom Nodes necessarios:\n- custom_nodes/Comfyui-SynthidBypass/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-GGUF/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Subpack/   <-- UltralyticsDetectorProvider\n- custom_nodes/rgthree-comfy/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-KJNodes/\n- custom_nodes/RES4LYF/                 <-- sampler=res_2s, scheduler=bong_tangent\n\nModelos padrao (GGUF Q4 - todas as GPUs):\n- models/diffusion_models/qwen-image-2512-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/clip/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n- models/model_patches/qwen_image_canny_diffsynth_controlnet.safetensors\n- models/loras/Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-fp32.safetensors\n- models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/clip/Qwen_3_4b-imatrix-IQ4_XS.gguf\n- models/vae/ae.safetensors\n- models/ultralytics/bbox/yolov8n-face.pt\n- models/sams/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\n\nModelos bf16 opcionais (RTX 6000 Pro 96GB):\n- models/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2512_bf16.safetensors\n- models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Synthid-Bypass Video v2.0 - Model & Custom Nodes Map\n\nInstalacao rapida em servidor remoto (auto-detecta GPU):\n  bash setup_remote.sh            (auto-detect via nvidia-smi)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 4000pro    (RTX 4000 Pro 20GB)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 4500pro    (RTX 4500 Pro 24GB)\n  bash setup_remote.sh 6000pro    (RTX 6000 Pro 96GB + bf16)\n\nCustom Nodes necessarios:\n- custom_nodes/Comfyui-SynthidBypass/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-GGUF/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Subpack/   <-- UltralyticsDetectorProvider\n- custom_nodes/rgthree-comfy/\n- custom_nodes/ComfyUI-KJNodes/\n- custom_nodes/RES4LYF/                 <-- sampler=res_2s, scheduler=bong_tangent\n\nModelos padrao (GGUF Q4 - todas as GPUs):\n- models/diffusion_models/qwen-image-2512-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/clip/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n- models/model_patches/qwen_image_canny_diffsynth_controlnet.safetensors\n- models/loras/Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-fp32.safetensors\n- models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo-Q4_K_M.gguf\n- models/clip/Qwen_3_4b-imatrix-IQ4_XS.gguf\n- models/vae/ae.safetensors\n- models/ultralytics/bbox/yolov8n-face.pt\n- models/sams/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\n\nModelos bf16 opcionais (RTX 6000 Pro 96GB):\n- models/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2512_bf16.safetensors\n- models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors\n- models/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors"
      },
